    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d754">

                <pb facs="0855" n="763" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg763"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/9073</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Vopicka</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-08T13:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 8, 1918, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>175. Your 32 [<hi rendition="#italic">47</hi>], 5th. Department has wired
                    Petrograd and Moscow to endeavor secure safe conduct military and Red Cross
                    mission. Department relies on your judgment as to leaving Jassy but hopes
                    situation may develop so that you can remain.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
